r--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"136\" data-vbnamecard=\"136\">urskr</a> That sucks, dude. Hope your life starts to settle down. I may poke at the thing as-is, see if I can't get it working, if only for my own notekeeping. (I never realized how much I missed having a charm tree where I could go &quot;Okay, check this off... Now I can get these...&quot;)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-07T11:05:00-08:00","id":843524,"title":"","content":"Thanks, man \u2013 although I find &quot;sucks&quot; to be a much too strong description. I sure would like things to be more calm, but at the same time it's exhilarating to be in high demand.<br /> \u200b<br /> By the way, somebody made brilliant Charm Cascades and published them on Reddit, have a look at reddit.com/r/exalted/comments/3pwiez/exalted_3e_charm_cascades/<br /> Maybe you can print them and tick them off?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/136-urskr","name":"urskr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar136_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-07T11:18:16-08:00","id":843529,"title":"","content":"**Deleted**","signature":"","ed