lue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Then type gradlew run</div> </div> </div> </div>That's the most simple way to do it, safe for those terminally allergic to using a terminal screen.<br /> If you happen to be among the afflicted, you can run the main class, AnathemaBootLoader in IntelliJ IDEA:<br /> Find the class in module &quot;Anathema&quot;, right click it and choose to run it.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/136-urskr","name":"urskr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar136_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-07T23:07:41-08:00","id":843827,"title":"","content":"I tried running AnathemaBootLoader. But I just got error messages.<br /> <br /> I also tried the command line. That didn't work either, but that was probably my fault. I'm not good with command line stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/797631-why-craft-sucks-how-i-fixed-it\" target=\"_blank\">EX3 Craft Rewrite</a><br /> <br /> Sanctaphrax is not a person<br /> -Chejop Kejak","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1154-sanctaphrax","name":"Sanctaphrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1154_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-09T02:02:10-08:00","id":844404,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon 