"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1794-doran","name":"doran","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1794_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-13T06:05:23-07:00","id":864863,"title":"","content":"As per the monthly update, we're weeks or even days away from the Ex3 PoD release. How's it going with Anathema? The lack of updates for the past few months is a bit worrying.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3751-ferozstein","name":"Ferozstein","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3751_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-18T13:24:59-07:00","id":867776,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ferozstein</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/474023-state-of-anathema-for-third-edition?p=864863#post864863\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As per the monthly update, we're weeks or even days away from the Ex3 PoD release. How's it going with Anathema? The lack of updates for the past few months is a bit worrying.</div> </div> </div> </div>This isn't an official product and despite the fact that it was a stretch goal, urskr didn't want to be paid for precisely this reason. It sucks that we don't have a software character builder yet, but you have to keep in mind that this is a passion project. It will be finished when it's finished. If you want to help, contribute to the codebase yourself or try to find people to submit code to the github repository.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/259-overshee","name":"Overshee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar259_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T07:14:36-07:00","id":868398,"title":"","content":"Is anyone against me potentially porting this to C# from Java?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1794-doran","user":"doran","date":".  added 04-19-2016, 10:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1794-doran","name":"doran","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1794_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T08:23:56-07:00","id":868450,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>doran</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/474023-state-of-anathema-for-third-edition?p=868398#post868398\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is anyone against me potentially porting this to C# from Java?</div> </div> </div> </div>Have you looked at the codebase? It has a pretty extensive handrolled dependency injection system that may be a lot of work to port over.<br /> <br /> Also it's GPLv3 so you are ultimately free to do what you want.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5376-atg","name":"AtG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5376_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"691"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-23T13:30:20-07:00","id":872611,"title":"","content":"Can someone explain to me what i need to download and how to set it up for it to work?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","name":"Sakii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-23T14:20:31-07:00","id":872639,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sakii</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/474023-state-of-anathema-for-third-edition?p=872611#post872611\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can someone explain to me what i need to download and how to set it up for it to work?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> * Install git \u2014 <a href=\"https://git-scm.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://git-scm.com/</a><br /> * Install Java \u2014 <a href=\"https://java.com/en/download/\" target=\"_blank\">https://java.com/en/download/</a><br /> * Install Gradle \u2014 <a href=\"http://gradle.org/\" target=\"_blank\">http://gradle.org/</a><br /> * Open a command line prompt<br /> * Download the source code using git from github: git clone <a href=\"https://github.com/anathema/anathema_3e.git\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/anathema/anathema_3e.git</a><br /> * Change directory to the newly created anathema_3e directory<br /> * Run: gradle run<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2916-dorward","name":"dorward","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T18:58:45-07:00","id":878329,"title":"","content":"any news on anathema 3e's progress? thx =D","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1364-nemo_oceansoul","name":"Nemo_Oceansoul","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1364_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"68"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-01T17:32:47-07:00","id":879793,"title":"","content":"Unending Necro Hype Prana Activate!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8762-waywardpaladin","name":"WaywardPaladin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-01T20:40:21-07:00","id":879872,"title":"","content":"It has been less than two months since Urskr said he was busy with work projects. Let the man earn a living, at least for a few months.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/K9a6Pmp.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/998-korhal_iv","name":"Korhal_IV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"592"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-01T21:26:35-07:00","id":879893,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dorward</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/474023-state-of-anathema-for-third-edition?p=872639#post872639\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> * Install git \u2014 <a href=\"https://git-scm.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://git-scm.com/</a><br /> * Install Java \u2014 <a href=\"https://java.com/en/download/\" target=\"_blank\">https://java.com/en/download/</a><br /> * Install Gradle \u2014 <a href=\"http://gradle.org/\" target=\"_blank\">http://gradle.org/</a><br /> * Open a command line prompt<br /> * Download the source code using git from github: git clone <a href=\"https://github.com/anathema/anathema_3e.git\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/anathema/anathema_3e.git</a><br /> * Change directory to the newly created anathema_3e directory<br /> * Run: gradle run<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I got Anathema working using these instructions, although I had to install the Java Developer's Toolkit specifically in addition to the basic Java installation; as far as I can tell, it mostly works.<br /> <br /> When there's news, I'm sure Urs will let us know; in the mean time, if you're truly fiending, you can follow the project at the Git link and, I believe, set up an e-mail alert for when there's a new commit (a change to the code), so you'll be the first to know when there's progress being made.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7058-kerredai","name":"Kerredai","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T20:42:14-07:00","id":882500,"title":"","content":"There is an alternative possibility on the horizon... <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T10:07:33-07:00","id":911731,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dorward</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/474023-state-of-anathema-for-third-edition?p=872639#post872639\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> * Install git \u2014 <a href=\"https://git-scm.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://git-scm.com/</a><br /> * Install Java \u2014 <a href=\"https://java.com/en/download/\" target=\"_blank\">https://java.com/en/download/</a><br /> * Install Gradle \u2014 <a href=\"http://gradle.org/\" target=\"_blank\">http://gradle.org/</a><br /> * Open a command line prompt<br /> * Download the source code using git from github: git clone <a href=\"https://github.com/anathema/anathema_3e.git\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/anathema/anathema_3e.git</a><br /> * Change directory to the newly created anathema_3e directory<br /> * Run: gradle run<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'm feeling particularly slow. Downloaded and installed the first two. Downloaded Gradle but not really sure how to install it. Downloaded the clone from GitHub. But I'm not sure how to progress from there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11924-gailedon","name":"Gailedon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-02T11:56:47-07:00","id":924974,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dorward</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/474023-state-of-anathema-for-third-edition?p=872639#post872639\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> * Install git \u2014 <a href=\"https://git-scm.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://git-scm.com/</a><br /> * Install Java \u2014 <a href=\"https://java.com/en/download/\" target=\"_blank\">https://java.com/en/download/</a><br /> * Install Gradle \u2014 <a href=\"http://gradle.org/\" target=\"_blank\">http://gradle.org/</a><br /> * Open a command line prompt<br /> * Download the source code using git from github: git clone <a href=\"https://github.com/anathema/anathema_3e.git\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/anathema/anathema_3e.git</a><br /> * Change directory to the newly created anathema_3e directory<br /> * Run: gradle run<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I also tried to run this, but it came back with an error Execution failed for task ':Anathema:compileJava' could not find tools.jar.<br /> <br /> As far as I know this is the best place to report errors and ask for help.<br /> <br /> I also wanted to add my voice to the whole (I really want this to happen, and am willing to help chorus)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5172-navar","name":"Navar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5172_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-02T12:37:21-07:00","id":924986,"title":"","content":"Someone should do a Kickstarter or a petition to have this done. I think there is a lot of people out there willing throw a few bucks at this to bring it back to life.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like the Sun I am relentless even in death...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3293-rahod","name":"Rahod","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-02T13:02:08-07:00","id":924996,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rahod</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/474023-state-of-anathema-for-third-edition?p=924986#post924986\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Someone should do a Kickstarter or a petition to have this done. I think there is a lot of people out there willing throw a few bucks at this to bring it back to life.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/deluxe-exalted-3rd-edition/description\" target=\"_blank\">We</a> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/deluxe-exalted-3rd-edition/posts/500392\" target=\"_blank\">did</a>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">At </span></span></span><b>$575,000</b><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> of contributions, our </span></span></span><b>EX3 </b><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Dev Team will collaborate to create the </span></span></span><b>Official EX3 Anathema Character Management Toolkit</b><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">. This free software has evolved and grown with the development of </span></span></span><b>Exalted</b><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">, but now it is our aim to collaborate with the </span></span></span><b>Anathema </b><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">team for an</span></span></span><b>EX3 </b><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">version that releases with </span></span></span><b>EX3 </b><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">itself.</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The </span></span></span><b>next Stretch Goal</b><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> is to enable the creation of an official </span></span></span><b>EX3 Anathema Character Management Toolkit</b><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">. This free program evolved and grew up alongside the development of</span></span></span><b>Exalted</b><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">, but what we want to do for the first time is have the </span></span></span><b>EX3 </b><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Dev Team and the </span></span></span><b>Anathema</b><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Team work together during the creation of the book with the aim of having </span></span></span><b>EX3 Anathema</b><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">ready for use with the release of the book. Our intention is that this support in no way hinder the creation and development of </span></span></span><b>EX3</b><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">, so our Stretch Goal dollars will go towards helping to make this design collaboration possible. We might need to hire someone from outside the </span></span></span><b>EX3 </b><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Dev Team to be the go between, or we might need to fly the </span></span></span><b>Anathema </b><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Team to see the design ideas for </span></span></span><b>EX3 </b><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">that John has etched all over walls and floors of his apartment with his model Daiklaive. Or just buy everybody lots and lots of coffee. In any case, while we can and will support </span></span></span><b>Anathema </b><span style=\"color:#020621\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"